{"id": "california-college-arts-financial-close-and-late-audit", "title": "The art college’s slow financial close remained an audit finding five years later", "seconds": 43.8, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "677c420f9011d2a1", "words": 128, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In FY2021, late year-end books at the art college delayed interim financial reporting.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.55, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["The", "late", "books"], "sub": "The audit traced delays to the financial close", "source": "first"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The FY2022 auditors kept the finding open.", "t0": 5.67, "t1": 8.71, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "again", "layout": "table", "heading": "Financial close", "context": "Two audit years", "rows": [{"label": "FY2021", "value": "Significant deficiency"}, {"label": "FY2022", "value": "Incomplete correction"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In FY2023 the auditors raised it to a material weakness.", "t0": 8.93, "t1": 12.81, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "table", "source": "raised", "heading": "Financial close", "context": "Finding 2021-001", "rows": [{"label": "FY2023", "value": "Material weakness"}, {"label": "FY2024", "value": "Not fully corrected"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The weakness remained in the FY2024 audit.", "t0": 12.93, "t1": 15.91, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "later", "layout": "table", "heading": "Financial reporting", "context": "Financial control finding", "rows": [{"label": "FY2023", "value": "Material weakness"}, {"label": "FY2024", "value": "Material weakness"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Then a federal reporting deadline passed. The college’s fiscal year ended June 30, 2025.", "t0": 16.03, "t1": 22.11, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "submit", "kicker": "The college missed its federal reporting deadline", "text": "The federal deadline", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The nine-month date was March 31, 2026. The auditors cited a missed deadline.", "t0": 22.23, "t1": 27.5, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "submit", "layout": "table", "heading": "FY2025 filing", "context": "Nine-month reporting deadline", "rows": [{"label": "Year ended", "value": "June 30, 2025"}, {"label": "Nine months", "value": "March 31, 2026"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The auditors reported no questioned costs for the late filing.", "t0": 27.62, "t1": 30.66, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "submit", "kicker": "The college missed its federal reporting deadline", "text": "The financial effect", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The college said it designed a stronger monthly close but lacked capacity to implement it in FY2025.", "t0": 30.88, "t1": 36.95, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "The last signed audit still retained the finding", "text": "Management’s response", "mark": "Management’s"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The auditor still listed the financial reporting weakness at that year-end.", "t0": 37.07, "t1": 40.52, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "last", "kicker": "The last signed audit still retained the finding", "text": "The last audited result", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.64, "t1": 42.86, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The audit traced delays to the financial close", "b": "Repeated testing raised the severity", "o": "The last signed audit still retained the finding"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "person"}